-- 0004_seed_stats_history.sql
-- Historical chore_completions so the Statistics screen is populated and trends are non-zero.
-- All rows reference the stable daily chore a0000007 (Grocery shopping, due 11:00 UTC),
-- so "on time" is controlled by completed_at's time-of-day (before 11:00 = on time).
-- Member weighting: Mom (2222) > Dad (3333) > Ana (4444) > Ama (5555).
-- Dates anchor to the Monday of the week the migration is applied (date_trunc uses UTC).
-- Idempotent: fixed UUIDs + on conflict (id) do nothing.

